#. ja: マテリア精製:<if ($n1 > 0)>○<else>×</if>　武具投影:<if ($n2 > 0)>○<else>×</if>　<if ($n3 > 0)>分解適正スキル:<num $n4>.00<else>分解:×</if>
#. de: Mat.-Extraktion: <if ($n1 > 0)>✓<else>× </if>  Projektion: <if ($n2 > 0)>✓<else>× </if>  Verwertung: <if ($n3 > 0)><num $n4>,00<else>× </if>
#. fr: Matérialisable<nbsp>: <if ($n1 > 0)>✓<else>×</if>  Mirage<nbsp>: <if ($n2 > 0)>✓<else>×</if>  Recyclage<nbsp>: <if ($n3 > 0)>✓ [<num $n4>,00]<else>×</if>
#. macro: <if ($n1 > 0)>Y<else>N</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($n2 > 0)>Y<else>N</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 2 > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($n3 > 0)><num $n4>.00<else>N</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 3 > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <num $n4> — a number; value = number parameter 4 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "Addon:1361:0:0"
msgid "Extractable: <if ($n1 > 0)>Y<else>N</if>  Projectable: <if ($n2 > 0)>Y<else>N</if>  Desynthesizable: <if ($n3 > 0)><num $n4>.00<else>N</if>"
msgstr "Можно извлечь: <if ($n1 > 0)>Да<else>Нет</if>  Можно спроецировать: <if ($n2 > 0)>Да<else>Нет</if>  Можно разобрать: <if ($n3 > 0)><num $n4>.00<else>Нет</if>"

